# BMW 5 Series E39 four-door saloon, 1995-2004.
#
# The E39 5-series: 4,775 mm long, 1,800 mm wide, 1,435 mm high, 2,830 mm
# wheelbase; 2.0-4.4 petrol and 2.0/3.0 diesel, the 528i the volume six.
# Widely regarded as the high point of the executive BMW and a strong British
# fleet seller. https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/BMW_5_Series_(E39)
#
# Colours: Cosmos Black, Titanium Silver, Orient Blue and Oxford Green are
# documented BMW finishes of the period.
#
# Weight: 130 in total (black 40, silver 35, blue 30, green 25).
#
# Speed 230 km/h; comfort 125/518 (line). Classes 2,3.
# Dates: 1995-2004 with a road tail to about 2015.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/bmw-e39.blend. References:
# citycars/references/bmw-e39/ (gitignored). Images via Wikimedia Commons.

